{"id":"a550eca68af2a97f3059bbbaa5c5a2b08cc97fa0","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"a550eca68af2a97f3059bbbaa5c5a2b08cc97fa0","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/gvs-concurrent-slot-import.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+Concurrent installs sharing a global virtual store no longer fail with `failed to remove existing directory ... prior to swap: Directory not empty`, and no longer briefly remove a package directory another process is reading."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".changeset/napi-global-virtual-store.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/napi\": minor","+---","+","+`install` accepts `enableGlobalVirtualStore`, `globalVirtualStoreDir`, `packageExtensions` and `patchedDependencies`, and `readConfig` reports `enableGlobalVirtualStore`, `globalVirtualStoreDir`, `virtualStoreDir` and `effectiveVirtualStoreDir`. Hosts embedding the engine can now use the global virtual store, declare dependencies a package failed to declare, patch a package, and locate the virtual store instead of assuming `node_modules/.pnpm`."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/deploy.rs","lines":["@@ -741,7 +741,7 @@ fn copy_project<ReporterT: Reporter>(","         PackageImportMethod::CloneOrCopy,","         dest,","         &output.files_map,","-        ImportIndexedDirOpts { force: true, keep_modules_dir: false },","+        ImportIndexedDirOpts { force: true, ..ImportIndexedDirOpts::default() },","     )","     .map_err(miette::Report::new)","     .wrap_err(\"copy project files\")"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/deps-restorer/src/build_modules.rs","lines":["@@ -1559,7 +1559,11 @@ fn materialize_side_effects<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","         import_method,","         pkg_dir,","         overlay,","-        ImportIndexedDirOpts { force: true, keep_modules_dir: true },","+        ImportIndexedDirOpts {","+         